.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="f(x, y) = 100(y-x^2)^2 + (1-x)^2 has its minimum f=0 at (1, 1), at the end of a banana-shaped valley along the parabola y = x^2. The walls are steep, but the floor is almost flat, so a method without curvature information finds the valley quickly and then crawls along it.">

